sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Handler
    participant S as Store
    participant St as Stream keys
    participant P as Parent keys
    C->>H: DELETE /branch
    H->>H: authorize path · validate the stream URL
    H->>S: handleDelete → Store.Delete(path)
    S->>St: EVALSHA delete.lua
    Note over St: HGETALL → DEL all keys → PUBLISH d
    St-->>S: reply DELETED, forkedFrom
    S->>P: EVALSHA decr_ref.lua on the parent
    Note over P: HINCRBY refCount -1 · SREM :forks
    P-->>S: reply OK — or CASCADE, grandparent
    S-->>H: delete complete after the finite ancestor walk
    H-->>C: 204 No Content
